@startuml
title Car / Bike Vehicle Booking System - Activity Diagram
start
:Admin adds vehicle with unique access detail;
:Customer logs in;
:Browse available vehicles;
:Reserve vehicle for pickup and due date;
if (Reservation approved?) then (yes)
  :Make payment;
  :Log reservation event;
else (no)
  :Notify rejection to customer;
  stop
endif
if (Pickup date approaching?) then (yes)
  :Send pickup reminder;
else (no)
endif
:Customer picks up vehicle;
:Log pickup event;
if (Due date approaching?) then (yes)
  :Send due date reminder;
else (no)
endif
:Customer returns vehicle;
:Log return event;
:Update vehicle status to available;
stop
@enduml
